<mxCell id="m240" value="Expected O(n) time, O(n) memory, O(n²) if every key collides. A set answers yes/no; a value→index map answers where. Sorted input → the inward scan in O(1) memory." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="482" width="820" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
